 # Latent-Dimension Sweep

 The experiment evaluated latent dimensions:

 - 32
- 64
- 128
- 256
- 512

 Metrics included:

 - Teacher position MAE
- Student position MAE
- Student rotation MAE
- Gripper accuracy
- Latent MSE
- Latent cosine similarity
- Action-probe accuracy

 Recorded results:

 | Latent Dim | Student Params | Position MAE | Rotation MAE | Gripper Acc. | Latent MSE | Cosine Similarity | Action Probe |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 32 | 541,991 | 0.2911 | 0.00122 | 1.000 | 0.02819 | 0.9751 | 1.000 |
| 64 | 554,311 | 0.2898 | 0.00435 | 1.000 | 0.03051 | 0.9715 | 1.000 |
| 128 | 578,951 | 0.2899 | 0.00968 | 1.000 | 0.03514 | 0.9648 | 0.976 |
