 # VLA Architecture

 The long-term architecture is:

```
                         RGB
                          │
                     Vision Encoder
                          │
                         z_V
                      What / State
                          │
                          │
Language                  │
   │                      │
   ↓                      │
Language Encoder          │
   │                      │
  z_L                      │
   │                      │
   ├────→ p(z_V | L)       │
   │                      │
   └────→ p(z_A | L)       │
              │            │
              ↓            │
         Action latent     │
              │            │
              └──────┬─────┘
                     ↓
                   Fusion
                     ↓
              Action Planner
                     ↓
                Fast Policy
                     ↓
                     IK
                     ↓
                   Robot
```

 The exact placement of Fusion and Planner remains an active research question.

 The important architectural principle is that language, planning, and control should not all operate at the same timescale.

